<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>What our dear Lord desires the most,</l><l>Is not to just redeem the lost;</l><l>But that some saints would pay the cost,</l><l>To be His Bride forever.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>As virgins we must single be,</l><l>No other husband could have we,</l><l>That when He comes we’ll then be free</l><l>To be His Bride forever.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>How could we love this fading world,</l><l>When Christ desires that one great pearl;</l><l>To Him we must our love unfurl</l><l>To bring Him back forever.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
